# One name per line. Comments and blank lines ignored.
# Shared source of truth for:
#   - install.sh  wire_day_one_harnesses (skip vault rewire)
#   - Rust doctor / env_blind_agent_reason (include_str! this file)
#
# Also match harness stem <name>.conf to the same token.
