# kimi *does* read process.env for OpenAI-compatible providers; 0.33–0.34 only
# fail because of upstream kimi-code#2745 (fix in #2746). Do not re-add kimi
# as structurally env-blind. Use KIMI_CODE_LEGACY_FLAG for the interim gate.
